msgstr "Tumia rangi ya msisitizo kwa mpaka wa dirisha linalotumika"

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid "Remember window position (Wayland)"
msgstr "Kumbuka mahali pa dirisha (Wayland)"

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Save window position when a window closes\n"
"and restore it when it opens again.\n"
"Requires the Material Tiling Popup KWin script.\n"
"Windows of the same application without a distinct identity\n"
"share the state of the last closed window."
msgstr ""
"Huhifadhi mahali pa dirisha linapofungwa na kuparejesha linapofunguliwa tena.\n"
"Inahitaji hati ya Material Tiling Popup ya KWin.\n"
"Madirisha ya programu moja yasiyo na utambulisho\n"
"tofauti hushiriki hali ya dirisha lililofungwa mwisho."

#: src/kcm/ExceptionDialog.cc
msgid "Do not remember window position"
msgstr "Usikumbuke mahali pa dirisha"

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid "Window Management"
msgstr "Usimamizi wa Madirisha"

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid "Remember the screen where the window was last closed"
msgstr "Kumbuka skrini ambayo dirisha lilifungwa juu yake mara ya mwisho"

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Restore the saved screen.\n"
"When disabled, use the screen chosen by KWin when the window opens."
msgstr ""
"Hurejesha skrini iliyohifadhiwa.\n"
"Ikizimwa, hutumia skrini iliyochaguliwa na KWin dirisha linapofunguliwa."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid "Remember the virtual desktop where the window was last closed"
msgstr "Kumbuka eneo-kazi pepe ambalo dirisha lilifungwa ndani yake mara ya mwisho"

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Restore the saved virtual desktop, switch to it and activate the window.\n"
"When disabled, keep the desktop chosen when the window opens."
msgstr ""
"Hurejesha eneo-kazi pepe lililohifadhiwa, huhamia humo na kufanya dirisha litumike.\n"
"Ikizimwa, huhifadhi eneo-kazi lililochaguliwa dirisha lilipofunguliwa."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid "Resize other snapped windows when restoring saved proportions"
msgstr "Badilisha ukubwa wa madirisha mengine yaliyopangwa wakati wa kurejesha uwiano uliohifadhiwa"

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Allow restoring a snapped window's saved proportions to\n"
"resize other windows in the same quick-tile layout.\n"
"When disabled, restore the saved proportions only to the reopened window."
msgstr ""
"Huruhusu kurejesha uwiano uliohifadhiwa wa dirisha lililopangwa kubadili ukubwa wa\n"
"madirisha mengine katika mpangilio uleule wa haraka wa vigae.\n"
"Ikizimwa, hurejesha uwiano uliohifadhiwa kwa dirisha lililofunguliwa tena pekee."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid "Let KWin place additional windows of the same application"
msgstr "Acha KWin ipange madirisha ya ziada ya programu ileile"

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"When another normal window of the same application is already\n"
"open, leave position, screen, virtual desktop and tiling to KWin.\n"
"The first window still uses saved restoration.\n"
"When disabled, apply the restoration settings to\n"
"additional windows too, cascading overlapping windows."
msgstr ""
"Ikiwa dirisha jingine la kawaida la programu ileile tayari limefunguliwa,\n"
"huiachia KWin mahali, skrini, eneo-kazi pepe na upangaji wa vigae.\n"
"Dirisha la kwanza bado hurejesha hali iliyohifadhiwa.\n"
"Ikizimwa, hutumia mipangilio ya kurejesha pia kwa madirisha\n"
"ya ziada, na hupanga yanayofunikana kwa ngazi."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Show the window title on mouse over when it is\n"
"hidden due to limited space or shortened to fit.\n"
"Requires the application menu to be always visible."
msgstr ""
"Huonyesha kichwa cha dirisha kishale kinapopita juu yake\n"
"ikiwa kimefichwa au kufupishwa kutokana na nafasi ndogo.\n"
"Inahitaji menyu ya programu ionekane kila wakati."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Center aligns the title within the available space.\n"
"Center (Full Width) centers it on the window,\n"
"shifting it to avoid menus and buttons."
msgstr ""
"Katikati huweka kichwa katikati ya nafasi iliyopo.\n"
"Katikati (upana wote) hukipanga katikati ya dirisha,\n"
"ikikisogeza ili kuepuka menyu na vitufe."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Adjusts the opacity of the active window title bar and borders.\n"
"Does not change the opacity of the window contents."
msgstr ""
"Hubadilisha kiwango cha kutopitisha mwanga cha upau\n"
"wa kichwa na mipaka ya dirisha linalotumika.\n"
"Haibadilishi kiwango cha kutopitisha mwanga cha yaliyomo dirishani."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Adjusts the opacity of inactive window title bars and borders.\n"
"Does not change the opacity of the window contents."
msgstr ""
"Hubadilisha kiwango cha kutopitisha mwanga cha pau\n"
"za vichwa na mipaka ya madirisha yasiyotumika.\n"
"Haibadilishi kiwango cha kutopitisha mwanga cha yaliyomo madirishani."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Uses square corners when a window is snapped to a tiling zone.\n"
"Floating windows keep the configured corner rounding."
msgstr ""
"Hutumia pembe za mraba dirisha linapopangwa kwenye eneo la vigae.\n"
"Madirisha huru huhifadhi mviringo wa pembe uliowekwa."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Uses the selected colors for borders and the outline, if enabled.\n"
"When disabled, uses the frame color from the window color scheme."
msgstr ""
"Hutumia rangi zilizochaguliwa kwa mipaka na mstari wa nje, ukiwa umewashwa.\n"
"Ikizimwa, hutumia rangi ya fremu kutoka kwenye mpangilio wa rangi wa dirisha."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Uses the window color scheme accent color instead\n"
"of the manually selected active border color.\n"
"Also applies to the outline."
msgstr ""
"Hutumia rangi ya msisitizo ya mpangilio wa rangi wa dirisha\n"
"badala ya rangi ya mpaka hai iliyochaguliwa kwa mkono.\n"
"Hutumika pia kwa mstari wa nje."

#: src/kcm/config.ui src/kcm/ExceptionDialog.cc
msgid ""
"Draws a thin line around the window\n"
"using the active or inactive border color.\n"
"The outline stays opaque even when the decoration is transparent."
msgstr ""
"Huchora mstari mwembamba kuzunguka dirisha kwa rangi ya mpaka unaotumika au usiotumika.\n"
"Mstari wa nje hubaki usiopitisha mwanga hata mapambo yakiwa wazi."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Hides the title when the application menu\n"
"leaves less space than the configured minimum.\n"
"When disabled, keeps the title visible and shortens it as needed."
msgstr ""
"Huficha kichwa menyu ya programu inapoacha nafasi\n"
"ndogo kuliko kiwango cha chini kilichowekwa.\n"
"Ikizimwa, huacha kichwa kionekane na kukifupisha inapohitajika."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Minimum width in pixels available beside the\n"
"application menu before the title is hidden.\n"
"Only applies when hiding the title for limited space is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Upana wa chini kabisa kwa pikseli karibu na menyu kabla kichwa hakijafichwa.\n"
"Hutumika tu ikiwa kuficha kichwa kutokana na nafasi ndogo kumewashwa."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Keeps the application menu visible in the title bar.\n"
"When disabled, the menu appears on mouse over."
msgstr ""
"Huacha menyu ya programu ionekane kwenye upau wa kichwa.\n"
"Ikizimwa, menyu huonekana kishale kinapopita juu yake."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Adds a button to find and run application menu commands.\n"
"Requires the application to export its menu to the decoration."
msgstr ""
"Huongeza kitufe cha kutafuta na kutekeleza amri za menyu ya programu.\n"
"Programu lazima itoe menyu yake kwa mapambo ya dirisha."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Includes unavailable commands in search results.\n"
"They remain disabled and cannot be run."
msgstr ""
"Hujumuisha amri zisizopatikana katika matokeo ya utafutaji.\n"
"Hubaki zimezimwa na haziwezi kutekelezwa."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Excludes top-level menu names, such as File or Edit, from matching.\n"
"Commands inside those menus are still searched."
msgstr ""
"Huondoa majina ya menyu za juu, kama Faili au Hariri, kwenye ulinganisho.\n"
"Amri zilizo ndani ya menyu hizo bado hutafutwa."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Searches command names only, excluding the names of their parent menus.\n"
"Also enables ignoring top-level menu labels."
msgstr ""
"Hutafuta majina ya amri tu, bila majina ya menyu zinazozibeba.\n"
"Huwasha pia kupuuza majina ya menyu za ngazi ya juu."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Finds approximate matches, including minor typing errors, and ranks results by relevance.\n"
"When disabled, searches for the typed text as a substring."
msgstr ""
"Hutafuta ulinganifu wa kukadiria, ikijumuisha makosa madogo\n"
"ya kuandika, na kupanga matokeo kwa umuhimu.\n"
"Ikizimwa, hutafuta maandishi yaliyoingizwa kama sehemu ya majina."

#: src/kcm/config.ui src/kcm/ExceptionDialog.cc
msgid ""
"Collects the application menu in one button instead of\n"
"showing separate top-level menu buttons in the title bar."
msgstr ""
"Hukusanya menyu ya programu kwenye kitufe kimoja badala ya kuonyesha\n"
"vitufe tofauti vya menyu za juu kwenye upau wa kichwa."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Adds horizontal space on both sides of\n"
"menu labels in the title bar.\n"
"Higher values make the buttons wider."
msgstr ""
"Huongeza nafasi ya mlalo pande zote mbili za\n"
"majina ya menyu kwenye upau wa kichwa.\n"
"Thamani kubwa hufanya vitufe kuwa vipana zaidi."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Uses the system menu font.\n"
"When disabled, uses the title bar font."
msgstr ""
"Hutumia fonti ya menyu ya mfumo.\n"
"Ikizimwa, hutumia fonti ya upau wa kichwa."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Uses system selection colors to highlight application menu buttons.\n"
"When disabled, uses the decoration button highlighting."
msgstr ""
"Hutumia rangi za uteuzi za mfumo kuangazia vitufe vya menyu ya programu.\n"
"Ikizimwa, hutumia uangaziaji wa vitufe vya mapambo."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Uses the window color scheme for popup menus and the tiling popup.\n"
"When disabled, uses the default system palette."
msgstr ""
"Hutumia mpangilio wa rangi wa dirisha kwa\n"
"menyu ibukizi na kidirisha cha vigae.\n"
"Ikizimwa, hutumia paleti ya chaguo-msingi ya mfumo."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Adjusts shadow opacity without changing its size.\n"
"Higher values make the shadow stronger."
msgstr ""
"Hubadilisha kiwango cha kutopitisha mwanga cha kivuli bila kubadilisha ukubwa wake.\n"
"Thamani kubwa hufanya kivuli kiwe na nguvu zaidi."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Hold Maximize to show snapping zones, Minimize to minimize other windows\n"
"on the screen, or Close to minimize to the system tray.\n"
"Requires the corresponding support or scripts.\n"
"See the information button for requirements."
msgstr ""
"Shikilia Panua ili kuona maeneo ya kupanga, Punguza ili kupunguza madirisha\n"
"mengine kwenye skrini, au Funga ili kupunguza hadi trei ya mfumo.\n"
"Inahitaji usaidizi au hati zinazohusika.\n"
"Angalia mahitaji kwenye kitufe cha taarifa."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid "Time to hold a window button before its additional action is triggered."
msgstr ""
"Muda wa kushikilia kitufe cha dirisha kabla\n"
"ya kitendo chake cha ziada kutekelezwa."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Shows snapping zones when the pointer stays over Maximize, without clicking.\n"
"Requires the Material Tiling Popup KWin script."
msgstr ""
"Huonyesha maeneo ya kupanga kishale kinapobaki juu ya Panua, bila kubofya.\n"
"Inahitaji hati ya Material Tiling Popup ya KWin."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Time to wait before opening the tiling\n"
"popup while the pointer stays over Maximize."
msgstr ""
"Muda wa kusubiri kabla ya kufungua kidirisha\n"
"cha vigae kishale kinapobaki juu ya Panua."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Allows window dragging to start from decoration\n"
"buttons such as Minimize and Maximize.\n"
"Application menu buttons still allow dragging when this is disabled."
msgstr ""
"Huruhusu kuanza kuburuta dirisha kutoka kwenye vitufe\n"
"vya mapambo kama Punguza na Panua.\n"
"Kuburuta kutoka kwenye vitufe vya menyu ya programu bado kunapatikana ikizimwa."

#: src/kcm/ExceptionDialog.cc
msgid ""
"Enter the text to match against the window title or class.\n"
"Use Detect Window Properties to capture it from an open window."
msgstr ""
"Ingiza maandishi ya kulinganisha na kichwa au darasa la dirisha.\n"
"Tumia utambuzi wa sifa za dirisha kuyapata kutoka dirisha lililofunguliwa."

#: src/kcm/ExceptionDialog.cc
msgid ""
"The title is the text shown in\n"
"the title bar and may change.\n"
"The class identifies the application."
msgstr ""
"Kichwa ni maandishi kwenye upau wa kichwa na kinaweza kubadilika.\n"
"Darasa hutambulisha programu."

#: src/kcm/ExceptionDialog.cc
msgid ""
"Exact Match requires the whole value.\n"
"Substring Match finds the text anywhere within it.\n"
"Matching is case-insensitive and does not use regular expressions."
msgstr ""
"Ulinganisho Kamili huhitaji thamani yote.\n"
"Ulinganisho wa Sehemu ya Maandishi hutafuta maandishi popote ndani ya thamani.\n"
"Herufi kubwa na ndogo hazitofautishwi na hakuna matumizi ya semi za kawaida."

#: src/kcm/ExceptionDialog.cc
msgid ""
"Excludes matching windows from saving and restoring their\n"
"position, even when enabled in the global settings."
msgstr ""
"Huondoa madirisha yanayolingana katika kuhifadhi na kurejesha mahali\n"
"pake, hata ikiwa imewashwa kwenye mipangilio ya jumla."

#: src/kcm/ExceptionDialog.cc
msgid ""
"Overrides whether menus follow decoration colors for matching windows.\n"
"Use global setting keeps the general preference."
msgstr ""
"Hubatilisha mpangilio wa kufuata rangi za mapambo kwa menyu za madirisha yanayolingana.\n"
"Tumia mpangilio wa jumla huhifadhi chaguo la jumla."

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid "Restore window sizes"
msgstr "Rejesha ukubwa wa madirisha"

#: src/kcm/config.ui
msgid ""
"Restore the saved size of floating windows independently of their position.\n"
"When disabled, applications choose the size.\n"
"Maximized, fullscreen and snapped windows keep their existing behavior."
msgstr ""
"Hurejesha ukubwa uliohifadhiwa wa madirisha huru bila kutegemea mahali yalipo.\n"
"Ikizimwa, programu huchagua ukubwa.\n"
"Madirisha yaliyokuzwa, ya skrini nzima na yaliyonasishwa hubaki na tabia yake ya sasa."
